      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Recently contracted HOTT Electrics to augment our existing seven year old 4.9kW, Fronius/Trina installation. Their’s was one of four quotes obtained, and involved onsite inspection and discussion with the actual installer as opposed to remote/unseen estimates from the other three.  Answers to all our many questions with respect to this installation (including the complete upgrade of our old asbestos-backed switchboard which also became necessary) were readily provided and explained, as were system design suggestions/options to best suit our particular needs and situation.  All work was carried out by a very courteous, punctual, well-presented and totally professional crew, who were a credit to the business. There has also been prompt follow-ups in relation to metering and system performance.  The augmentation involved adding another separate string comprised of a Sungrow SH5.0RS hybrid inverter, Trina Vertex S+ 440w panels (1.76kW) with additional cabling for future expansion and a Sungrow SBR096 battery. Total system size now 6.66kW. Everything is working to specification and we are especially pleased with amount of visibility we now have of our power utilisation, that monitoring for all PV (both old and new) is handled efficiently by a single Sungrow app, having a backup capability and a future-proofed outcome.  Grid connection and all other grid-related issues were dealt with by the installer.P.S.  HOTT's belief in retaining and simply augmenting our existing system was an unprompted confirmation of a similar recommendation provided in prior exchanges we had with Anthony and Kim of SoarQuotes!",
